    "source": "EnergyPlus 9.5.0-de239b2e5f; Building: part-I; Run Period: RUN PERIOD 01; Weather: OLYMPIA-AP - USA Custom-727920 WMO#=727920; 8760 simulated hours; source file: cem 20240425Table(1).html.",
    "disclaimer": "The source monthly report identifies January through December but does not expose an explicit simulation calendar year. A nominal non-leap reference year (2001) is used only for BPOR timestamp encoding; it does not assert a 2001 simulation year.",
    "notes": "All serialized energy is site energy in kWh. Native monthly EnergyPlus electricity kWh values are retained exactly as reported. Monthly natural-gas therm values are converted to kWh using the EnergyPlus documented gas-meter conversion factor. The EnergyPlus annual IP kBtu tables are retained only as audit references because their IP-unit conversion basis is not numerically identical to the native monthly meter conversions. Water, source energy, recovered thermal energy, and non-energy performance metrics are outside BPOR scope."
